{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James! Hope you're doing great. I've some amazing news - I held a gaming tourney with my buddies last night. We played Fortnite and a few other games. We raised a decent amount for a children's hospital. Combining gaming and a good cause felt awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-92c4767db7e8d799050876c8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:47:52.584136+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "92c4767db7e8d799050876c8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "92c4767db7e8d799050876c8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Awesome job organizing a gaming tournament for a children's hospital! Combining gaming and a good cause - that's really cool! Tell me more about who helped out and what other games were played."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-a00e2ef0c636ca0bcacd1360", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:47:56.680751+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a00e2ef0c636ca0bcacd1360", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a00e2ef0c636ca0bcacd1360", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! We all pulled together for a great cause. My gaming pals and I also played Overwatch and Apex Legends. Everyone had a blast raising money for the kids' hospital. The atmosphere was awesome and everyone was so competitive. In the end, we raised a good amount. Feels good to use our love of gaming for good!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-8664a358f5cae32f72eb6fe5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:00.781772+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8664a358f5cae32f72eb6fe5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8664a358f5cae32f72eb6fe5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, that sounds like a blast! It's great how gaming can bring people together like that. You made a huge difference in the kids' lives! Do you have any photos from the tournament?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-9c7efd5671ff6f9ca4f1af0c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:04.860612+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9c7efd5671ff6f9ca4f1af0c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9c7efd5671ff6f9ca4f1af0c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I got a great shot at the tournament. Check it out! Everyone was so hyped, and it felt great knowing we were playing for a good cause."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-96db31cac922c5caba4490ea", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:08.940843+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "96db31cac922c5caba4490ea", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "96db31cac922c5caba4490ea", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, this photo rocks!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-09807c216affbd76d7d4f344", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:13.041276+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "09807c216affbd76d7d4f344", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "09807c216affbd76d7d4f344", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! I'm glad you enjoyed it. It was a really awesome moment - unforgettable for all of us! What's new with you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-6f49942f6307fccaf8992aab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:17.149095+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6f49942f6307fccaf8992aab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6f49942f6307fccaf8992aab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I actually have something new, Samantha and I have decided to move in together!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-29d59cd944b8f03f09a2b0d5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:21.229197+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "29d59cd944b8f03f09a2b0d5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "29d59cd944b8f03f09a2b0d5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, that's a really big decision! I hope you both have weighed the pros and cons. Where are you going to live?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-6549537bbdb73617fda95b0e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:25.332061+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6549537bbdb73617fda95b0e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6549537bbdb73617fda95b0e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Of course, this was a mutual and informed decision. We rented an apartment not far from McGee's bar."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-a4c41563b810935ee7d38218", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:29.433520+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a4c41563b810935ee7d38218", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a4c41563b810935ee7d38218", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: You love spending time together in this bar, don't you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-321be5e7c4fa76d6b19541b7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:33.504270+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "321be5e7c4fa76d6b19541b7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "321be5e7c4fa76d6b19541b7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: We just love it! I\u2019ll be honest, one of the criteria for our choice of apartment was this particular bar nearby."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-2a1d646c3202721948ee7c6a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:37.589215+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a1d646c3202721948ee7c6a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a1d646c3202721948ee7c6a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Awesome, James! Excited to hear how it goes. Keep me posted and good luck!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-a33d91431da5733b9fd6ebb4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:41.677366+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a33d91431da5733b9fd6ebb4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a33d91431da5733b9fd6ebb4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks, John! I'll be sure to keep you updated. I really appreciate your support. Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-1d1fed7e979d71dcd58630b5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:45.761702+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1d1fed7e979d71dcd58630b5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1d1fed7e979d71dcd58630b5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: No worries! I'm here for you whenever you need. Stay safe and chat soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-834b10c29508fb06917c349d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:49.870169+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "834b10c29508fb06917c349d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "834b10c29508fb06917c349d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks! Appreciate your support. Stay safe and talk to you soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R4-locomo-conv-47/session_29-859a519cba0bb053c3e3b438", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-10T10:48:53.982772+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "859a519cba0bb053c3e3b438", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "859a519cba0bb053c3e3b438", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
